  <h2>1. The service</h2>
  <p>
    extport helps browser-extension developers publish to the browser stores, see usage analytics, and sell license
    keys through their own Stripe account. extport is currently in beta and free to use. When pricing is introduced,
    developers will get advance notice. Anything set up during the beta will keep working, and nothing will be charged
